OL,3,GNEWSATeen not qualified to fell tree
OL,4,Athat killed him - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn apprentice tree surgeon died after
OL,7,Fbeing crushed by a tree he was not
OL,8,Fqualified to fell, an inquest has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FJonty Parkinson, who was the former
OL,12,Fnephew of England legend Gary Lineker,
OL,13,Fhad been working in woodland on a
OL,14,FNational Trust site near Faringdon, in
OL,15,FOxfordshire.
OL,17,FOn 6 September 2024, the 18-year-old,
OL,18,Ffrom Cirencester, died from crush
OL,19,Finjuries to his abdomen, caused after a
OL,20,Ftree he partially felled with a
OL,21,Fchainsaw did not fall in the intended
OL,22,Fway.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
