OL,3,GNEWSATeen not qualified to fell tree
OL,4,Athat killed him - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury inquest was told the teenager
OL,7,Fand his colleague Joe Bristow had used
OL,8,Fan assisted felling technique for which
OL,9,Fneither were qualified.
